{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日の朝、\n駅のホームで学校の先輩にあって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日の夜、\n友達とご飯食べてたら\nメンバーの友達がいたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまたま会えちゃった１日でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、\nママがお母さん同士でご飯行ってて\n中田は仕事で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家出る前にパパが\n「最寄り駅からの家まで車で送るからママと時間あわせて帰ってきて」\nって言ってきて\n「そんなの無理だよー」\nって言うじゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、帰りに電車乗ってすぐ\nママに連絡しようかな、とか思ってた時に\nん？なんか聞いたことある声？って思って横見たら\nママだったの！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家に帰るまでに\nまだ乗り換えがあるくらいの遠さのところでだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/26/1708995/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも\nそこそこ人が乗ってる電車だから\nかなり近い距離だった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/26/1708995/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じ路線を使ったことも\n同じ電車に乗ったことも\n同じ車両に乗ったこともすごい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"偶然が重なるなー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/26/1708995/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/26/1708995/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は生ドルだよ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/26/1708995/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めでたい！！2周年記念SP"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/26/1708995/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"19時から！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒崎真音さん\n東京パフォーマンスドールさん\n妄想キャリブレーションさん\n篠崎愛さん\n乃木坂46"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂は\n今回初めて\n2期生ちゃん来ちゃいます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/26/1708995/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://live.nicovideo.jp/watch/lv217912212"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てね！\nリアルタイムで見れないかたはタイムシフトしといて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}